INSERT INTO corpus VALUES(714,'https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9231442','Cannabinoids in Neurology - Position paper from Scientific Departments from Brazilian Academy of Neurology.','Brucki SMD, Adoni T, Almeida CMO, Andrade DC, Anghinah R, Barbosa LM, Bazan R, Carvalho AAS, Carvalho W, Christo PP, Coletta MD, Conforto AB, Correa-Neto Y, Engelhardt E, França Junior MC, Franco C, VON Glehn F, Gomes HR, Houly CGB, Kaup AO, Kowacs F, Kanashiro A, Lopes VG, Maia D, Manreza M, Martinez ARM, Martinez SCG, Nader SN, Neves LO, Okamoto IH, Oliveira RAA, Peixoto FM, Pereira CB, Saba RA, Sampaio LPB, Schilling LP, Silva MTT, Silva ER, Smid J, Soares CN, Sobreira-Neto M, Sousa NAC, Souza LC, Teive HAG, Terra VC, Vale M, Vieira VMG, Zanoteli E, Prado G.','2021','phytocannabinoids peripherical resumo canabinoides compreendem endocanabinoides fitocanabinoides canabinoides sinteticos desempenham acoes nervoso periferico quantidade enorme publicacoes lancada ultimos embora seja conhecida milenios departamentos cientificos descreveram evidencias suas literatura constantes mudancas possiveis novas evidencias podem surgir proximos prescricao dessas substancias discutida suas familias conhecimento adversos eficacia palavras chave canabinoides canabidiol phytocannabinoids phytocannabinoids terpenophenolic psychotomimetic aea arachydonoilglycerol hyperpolarization messengers endocannabinoidome mhra nabilone cesamet dronabinol marinol secretaries agencia anvisa importing anvisa rdc335 hemp paleobotanical circa millennia rope cloth millennia persia hemp hashish dagga bhang locoweed maconha canamo linnaeus linnaeus indica lamarck ruderalis janischevsky aryans scythians thracians dacians shamans trance scythians hemp ritual herodotus aryans assyrians ceremonies qunubu kanab κανναβις kannabis scythian thracian terpenoids cannabinol 1890s phytocannabinoids cannabigerol cannabichromene tetrahydrocannabivarin cannabicyclol cannabinol temperate climates climates aea unprocessed ebers papy