s currently collaborating in a research project. Dr. Germán Latorre González is consultant for Novartis, Chiesi, Allergan and Teva and is currently conducting clinical research with Novartis, Allergan and Teva. Almudena Layos has been a consultant for Novartis y Abbvie, with whom he is currently collaborating in a research project. JJM has been a consultant for Janssen Cilag and MSD Spain, with whom he is currently collaborating in a research project. Footnotes Publisher’s Note Springer Nature remains neutral with regard to jurisdictional claims in published maps and institutional affiliations. Contributor Information Patricia Pozo-Rosich, Email: ppozorosich@yahoo.com. Alba Martínez-García, Email: alba.mgarcia@umh.es. Julio Pascual, Email: juliopascualgomez@gmail.com. Emilio Ignacio, Email: emilio.ignacio@uca.es. Ángel L. Guerrero-Peral, Email: gueneurol@gmail.com José Balseiro-Gómez, Email: jbalseirogomez@gmail.com. Jesús Porta-Etessam, Email: jporta@yahoo.com. Germán Latorre-González, Email: Ger.latorre@gmail.com. Almudena Layos-Romero, Email: almudenalayos@gmail.com. César Lucas, Email: clucasrodenas@gmail.com. José J. Mira, Email: jose.mira@umh.es References 1. Headache Classification Committee of the International Headache Society Classification and diagnostic criteria for headache disorders, cranial neuralgias and facial pain. Cephalalgia. 1988;8(Suppl 7):1–96. [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 2. Headache Classification Committee of the International Headache Society (IHS) The international classification of headache disorders, 3rd edition (beta version) Cephalalgia. 2013;33:629–808. doi: 10.1177/0333102413485658. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 3. Steiner TJ. World headache Alliance. Lifting the burden: the global campaign against headache. Lancet Neurol. 2004;3:204–205. doi: 10.1016/S1474-4422(04)00703-3. [ DOI ] [ PubMed ] [ Google Scholar ] 4. Steiner TJ. Lifting the burden: the global campaign to reduce the burden of headache worldwide. J Headache Pain